<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The heavenly diet fulfills God’s great plan</l><l>Because it supplies and reconstitutes man</l><l>To build up the church, His unique dwelling place.</l><l>For this heavenly manna, Lord give us the taste!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
